---
const stats = [
    { value: '10', label: 'digits, each used once' },
    { value: '2', label: 'five-digit numbers' },
    { value: '12,400', label: 'puzzles to discover' },
    { value: '0', label: 'sign-ups needed' },
]
---
<section id="about" class="section" aria-labelledby="about-title">
    <div class="container">
        <div class="about card">
            <div class="about-copy">
                <p class="eyebrow">About the game</p>
                <h2 id="about-title">A tiny puzzle with a <span class="text-gradient">big personality</span></h2>
                <p>In the board above there are shown two variants of the same multiplication, by reversing the order of the factors.</p>
                <p>Knowing that the two numbers are built with all digits from zero to nine, each used only once, your quest is to find the multiplication operation.</p>
                <p>Mable is made by <a href="https://www.voltable.com/">Voltable.com</a> and runs right in your browser. Grab a coffee, warm up your number sense and see how quickly you can spot the pattern.</p>
            </div>
            <ul class="stats" aria-label="Mable in numbers">
                {stats.map((stat) => (
                    <li>
                        <strong>{stat.value}</strong>
                        <span>{stat.label}</span>
                    </li>
                ))}
            </ul>
        </div>
    </div>
</section>

<style>
.about {
    position: relative;
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: minmax(0, 7fr) minmax(0, 5fr);
    gap: clamp(2rem, 5vw, 4rem);
    align-items: center;
    padding: clamp(1.75rem, 5vw, 3.5rem);
    overflow: hidden;
}
.about::before {
    content: "";
    position: absolute;
    top: -40%;
    right: -20%;
    width: 60%;
    aspect-ratio: 1;
    border-radius: 50%;
    background: radial-gradient(circle, rgb(255 204 0 / .35), transparent 70%);
    pointer-events: none;
}
.about-copy h2 {
    font-size: clamp(2rem, 4.5vw, 3rem);
    margin-bottom: 1.25rem;
}
.about-copy p {
    color: var(--muted);
    font-size: 1.1rem;
}
.about-copy p + p {
    margin-top: .9rem;
}
.stats {
    position: relative;
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: repeat(2, minmax(0, 1fr));
    gap: 1rem;
    margin: 0;
    padding: 0;
    list-style: none;
}
.stats li {
    display: grid;
    gap: .2rem;
    padding: 1.25rem;
    border-radius: var(--radius);
    background: var(--surface-solid);
    border: 1px solid var(--border);
    text-align: center;
    transition: transform .3s var(--ease-bounce);
}
.stats li:hover {
    transform: translateY(-4px) scale(1.03);
}
.stats strong {
    font-family: var(--display);
    font-size: clamp(2rem, 4vw, 2.6rem);
    font-weight: 700;
    line-height: 1.1;
}
.stats li:nth-child(1) strong { color: var(--sun-ink); }
.stats li:nth-child(2) strong { color: var(--pink-ink); }
.stats li:nth-child(3) strong { color: var(--grape-ink); }
.stats li:nth-child(4) strong { color: var(--mint-ink); }
.stats span {
    color: var(--muted);
    font-size: .9rem;
    font-weight: 700;
}
@media (max-width: 860px) {
    .about {
        grid-template-columns: 1fr;
    }
}
</style>
